Stop saying only "au revoir" 👋 Say goodbye like a French person

• à tout à l'heure = see you later (today)
• à demain = see you tomorrow
• à bientôt = see you soon
• à plus = see ya (casual)
• salut = bye (casual)

👋 How would you say bye to a friend tomorrow? Comment "À ___" 👇
💌 Save this for your next goodbye
👯 Send it to your French-learning buddy

Small steps. Big dreams ✨

